<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="NepalSathi — a citizen-first Nepal service guide for documents, government services, education, jobs, travel, safety and everyday tools.">
<title>NepalSathi — Citizen Help for Nepal</title>
<style>
:root{
 --red:#d7193f;--red2:#ac1231;--blue:#1b55b7;--green:#147d43;--orange:#c87306;--purple:#6941c6;
 --bg:#f5f7fb;--card:#fff;--text:#172033;--muted:#667085;--line:#e5e9f0;--soft:#f2f4f7;
 --shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(16,24,40,.07);--shadow2:0 18px 55px rgba(16,24,40,.14)
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);line-height:1.5}
button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit}
button{cursor:pointer}
a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
.hidden{display:none!important}

.header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:1000;background:rgba(255,255,255,.96);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.nav{max-width:1260px;margin:auto;min-height:68px;padding:9px 18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:20px;font-weight:900;white-space:nowrap}
.logo{position:relative;width:32px;height:40px}
.logo:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:var(--red);clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 24%,68% 48%,100% 73%,0 100%)}
.logo:after{content:"★";position:absolute;left:5px;top:7px;color:#fff;font-size:12px}
.nav-search{flex:1;max-width:540px;position:relative;margin-left:10px}
.nav-search input{width:100%;height:42px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8f9fb;border-radius:23px;padding:0 16px 0 42px;outline:0}
.nav-search:before{content:"⌕";position:absolute;left:15px;top:7px;font-size:21px;color:#667085;z-index:1}
.nav-search input:focus{background:#fff;border-color:#b8c8e6;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px #edf2ff}
.nav-actions{display:flex;gap:7px;margin-left:auto}
.nav-actions button{border:0;background:var(--soft);color:#344054;border-radius:10px;height:40px;padding:0 11px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800}

.hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8f0a2b,#d7193f 55%,#eb5b77);color:#fff}
.hero-inner{max-width:1260px;margin:auto;padding:52px 22px 60px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.18fr) minmax(300px,.82fr);gap:30px;align-items:center}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,66px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-2.5px;max-width:800px}
.hero p{margin-top:15px;max-width:760px;font-size:17px;color:#ffe9ed}
.hero-search{display:flex;gap:6px;max-width:820px;background:#fff;border-radius:15px;padding:7px;margin-top:22px;box-shadow:0 14px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.18)}
.hero-search input{flex:1;min-width:0;border:0;outline:0;padding:13px 12px;font-size:16px}
.hero-search button{border:0;border-radius:10px;background:#111827;color:#fff;padding:0 18px;font-weight:900}
.hero-search .mic{background:#eef2f6;color:#344054;width:46px;padding:0}
.hero-note{margin-top:11px;font-size:12px;color:#ffdbe3}
.search-suggestions{
  position:absolute;
  left:0;right:0;top:calc(100% + 7px);
  background:#fff;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:12px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow2);
  overflow:hidden;
  z-index:2500;
  display:none;
  color:var(--text);
}
.search-suggestions.show{display:block}
.suggestion{
  display:flex;
  gap:10px;
  align-items:center;
  width:100%;
  border:0;
  background:#fff;
  text-align:left;
  padding:11px 13px;
}
.suggestion:hover{background:#f7f8fa}
.suggestion-icon{
  width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  background:#eef4ff;font-size:18px;flex:none
}
.suggestion-main{flex:1;min-width:0}
.suggestion-main b{display:block;font-size:12px}
.suggestion-main span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.search-hint{
  padding:9px 13px;font-size:10px;color:#98a2b3;
  background:#fafbfc;border-top:1px solid #eef1f4
}

.hero-card{background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);border-radius:18px;padding:21px}
.hero-card h3{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase}
.hero-card p{font-size:13px;margin-top:7px}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:14px}
.stat{background:rgba(0,0,0,.14);border-radius:11px;padding:10px}
.stat b{display:block;font-size:18px}.stat span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:#ffdfe6}

.main{max-width:1260px;margin:auto;padding:30px 22px 65px}
.section{margin-top:34px}
.section:first-child{margin-top:0}
.section-head{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-bottom:14px}
.section-head h2{font-size:24px}.section-head p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
.quick-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:13px}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:15px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:17px;transition:.18s}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 14px 37px rgba(16,24,40,.1)}
.quick{min-height:156px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}
.qicon{width:45px;height:45px;border-radius:12px;background:#eef4ff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px}
.quick h3{font-size:15px;margin-top:10px}.quick p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}
.btn{border:0;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:900}
.red{background:var(--red);color:#fff}.blue{background:#edf3ff;color:var(--blue)}.green{background:#e9f8ef;color:#0c7138}
.gray{background:var(--soft);color:#344054}.orange{background:#fff5e8;color:#8d5100}.purple{background:#f2edff;color:#5b36ac}

.answer{display:none;margin-top:13px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:20px}
.answer.show{display:block}
.answer-top{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}
.answer-icon{width:46px;height:46px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:12px;background:#eef4ff;font-size:22px;flex:none}
.answer h3{font-size:21px}.lead{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:2px}
.tags{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:9px}
.tag{background:#f2f4f7;color:#475467;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 8px;font-size:10px}
.steps{display:grid;gap:9px;margin-top:15px}
.step{display:flex;gap:10px;padding:11px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #eef1f4;border-radius:11px}
.num{width:27px;height:27px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:var(--red);color:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:900;flex:none}
.step b{display:block;font-size:13px}.step span{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:2px}
.checklist{margin-top:14px;border:1px dashed #cfd6df;border-radius:11px;padding:13px}
.check-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px}.check-head b{font-size:13px}
.check-item{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:center;padding:7px 0;font-size:12px;color:#344054}
.check-item input{accent-color:var(--red)}
.official{margin-top:14px;padding:11px 13px;background:#ecfdf3;border-left:4px solid var(--green);border-radius:9px;font-size:12px}
.warning{margin-top:9px;padding:11px 13px;background:#fffaeb;border-left:4px solid #f79009;border-radius:9px;font-size:12px;color:#7a4d00}
.actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:14px}
.savebar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:10px;color:#98a2b3}

.life-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}
.life{min-height:120px}.life b{font-size:14px}.life p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}.pills{display:flex;gap:5px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:9px}.pill{background:#f2f4f7;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:999px;color:#475467;font-size:10px}

.feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:13px}
.feature-icon{width:45px;height:45px;border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:21px}
.feature h3{font-size:15px;margin-top:10px}.feature p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px;line-height:1.55}

.multi-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px}
.tool h3{font-size:14px}.tool p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px}
.tool input,.tool select{width:100%;height:39px;margin-top:8px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:0 10px;outline:0;background:#fff}
.out{margin-top:9px;padding:9px;background:#f8fafc;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#344054}

.scam{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#061a29,#0d4d6b);color:#fff}
.scam p{color:#d5ecf6}.scam-area{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}.scam-area textarea{flex:1;min-height:95px;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:11px;outline:0;resize:vertical}.risk{display:none;margin-top:10px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.09);font-size:12px}.risk.show{display:block}.high{color:#ff9b9b}.med{color:#ffdb74}.low{color:#8cebad}

.track-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:13px}
.form-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px}.form-field label{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.form-field input,.form-field select{width:100%;height:39px;margin-top:5px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:0 9px;outline:0}
.track-list{display:grid;gap:7px;margin-top:11px}.track{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:#f8fafc;padding:9px;border-radius:9px}.track b{font-size:12px;flex:1}.track small{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}

.notice-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}
.notice{min-height:135px}.notice .badge{display:inline-block;font-size:9px;color:var(--red);font-weight:900;background:#fff0f3;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 7px}.notice h3{font-size:14px;margin-top:7px}.notice p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:4px}

.emergency{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px}.em{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;padding:15px}.em b{display:block;color:var(--red);font-size:20px}.em span{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:2px}.em small{display:block;color:#98a2b3;font-size:10px;margin-top:5px}

.saved-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px}.saved-item{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px;border-radius:10px}.saved-item b{font-size:12px;display:block}.saved-item span{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px}
.empty{text-align:center;padding:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

.footer{background:#101828;color:#d0d5dd}.footer-inner{max-width:1260px;margin:auto;padding:34px 22px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr;gap:25px}.footer h3{color:#fff;margin-bottom:7px}.footer p,.footer a{font-size:12px;color:#98a2b3;line-height:1.7}

.modal-bg{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.54);z-index:5000;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:18px}.modal-bg.show{display:flex}
.modal{width:min(94%,730px);max-height:88vh;overflow:auto;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow2);padding:20px}
.modal-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.close{width:34px;height:34px;border:0;background:var(--soft);border-radius:50%}.modal h2{font-size:21px}.modal-content{margin-top:14px}.modal-content p{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;white-space:pre-line}

.toast{position:fixed;right:20px;bottom:20px;z-index:7000;background:#111827;color:#fff;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:9px;font-size:12px;transform:translateY(90px);opacity:0;transition:.25s}.toast.show{transform:translateY(0);opacity:1}

@media(max-width:1100px){
 .hero-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr}
 .quick-grid,.multi-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
 .feature-grid,.life-grid,.notice-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
 .track-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
 .emergency{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
}
@media(max-width:700px){
 .nav-search{display:none}.nav-actions button:first-child{display:none}.brand{font-size:17px}
 .hero-inner{padding:40px 16px 46px}.main{padding:24px 16px 55px}
 .quick-grid,.multi-grid,.feature-grid,.life-grid,.notice-grid,.saved-grid,.emergency{grid-template-columns:1fr}
 .hero-search{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px}.hero-search input{grid-column:1/-1}.hero-search button{height:42px}.hero-search .mic{width:auto}
 .scam-area{display:block}.scam-area button{width:100%;margin-top:7px}
 .form-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
 .footer-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:28px 16px}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header class="header">
<nav class="nav">
  <div class="brand"><span class="logo"></span> NepalSathi</div>
  <div class="nav-search">
      <input id="topSearch" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Try: passport banauna k chaincha?">
      <div id="topSuggestions" class="search-suggestions"></div>
    </div>
  <div class="nav-actions">
    <button onclick="startVoiceSearch()">🎙️</button>
    <button onclick="showSaved()">⭐ Saved</button>
    <button onclick="openModal('Nepali / English','NepalSathi is designed to support both English and natural Nepali search. A production version should add a full human-reviewed Nepali translation layer.')">नेपाली / EN</button>
  </div>
</nav>
</header>

<section class="hero">
<div class="hero-inner">
  <div>
    <h1>One simple place for everyday Nepal.</h1>
    <p>Tell NepalSathi what you are trying to do. Get the next steps, preparation checklist, useful tools and the official place to finish the task.</p>
    <div class="hero-search" style="position:relative">
      <input id="heroSearch" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Try: “passport banauna k chaincha?”">
      <button class="mic" onclick="startVoiceSearch()">🎙️</button>
      <button onclick="searchSite()">SEARCH</button>
      <div id="heroSuggestions" class="search-suggestions"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-note">Independent guide • official links clearly marked • verify current requirements before applying</div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-card">
    <h3>Citizen dashboard</h3>
    <p>Built around real-life tasks rather than a giant list of government websites.</p>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat"><b>12+</b><span>Core service areas</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>20+</b><span>Citizen utilities</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>Saved</b><span>Checklists & reminders</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>Local</b><span>Browser-first data</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</section>

<main class="main">

<section id="resultsSection" class="section" style="display:none">
  <div class="section-head"><div><h2>Search results</h2><p>Matches based on your question.</p></div></div>
  <div id="results" class="notice-grid"></div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<div class="section-head"><div><h2>Start with your task</h2><p>Common things Nepali citizens need to do.</p></div></div>

<div class="quick-grid">
  <div class="card quick"><div><div class="qicon">🛂</div><h3>Passport</h3><p>Apply, appointment, status and replacement.</p></div><button class="btn red" onclick="showAnswer('passport')">Open guide</button></div>
  <div class="card quick"><div><div class="qicon">🪪</div><h3>National ID</h3><p>Pre-enrollment, enrollment and citizen services.</p></div><button class="btn red" onclick="showAnswer('nid')">Open guide</button></div>
  <div class="card quick"><div><div class="qicon">🚗</div><h3>Driving / vehicle</h3><p>License application, smart license and vehicle services.</p></div><button class="btn red" onclick="showAnswer('license')">Open guide</button></div>
  <div class="card quick"><div><div class="qicon">💳</div><h3>PAN / Tax</h3><p>PAN, taxpayer services and tax starting points.</p></div><button class="btn red" onclick="showAnswer('pan')">Open guide</button></div>
  <div class="card quick"><div><div class="qicon">🗳️</div><h3>Voter</h3><p>Voter registration and election services.</p></div><button class="btn red" onclick="showAnswer('voter')">Open guide</button></div>
  <div class="card quick"><div><div class="qicon">🎓</div><h3>Scholarships</h3><p>Official education scholarship notices.</p></div><button class="btn red" onclick="showAnswer('scholarship')">Open guide</button></div>
  <div class="card quick"><div><div class="qicon">🚨</div><h3>Online fraud</h3><p>Preserve evidence and report cybercrime.</p></div><button class="btn red" onclick="showAnswer('fraud')">Open guide</button></div>
  <div class="card quick"><div><div class="qicon">📜</div><h3>Citizenship</h3><p>Identify your case and start with the right office.</p></div><button class="btn red" onclick="showAnswer('citizenship')">Open guide</button></div>
</div>

<div id="answer" class="answer"></div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<div class="section-head"><div><h2>More citizen services</h2><p>The site should eventually cover the full set of everyday public-service journeys.</p></div></div>
<div class="life-grid">
  <div class="card life"><b>🏠 Land & property</b><p>Find official starting points for land records, maps, ownership and registration-related services.</p><div class="pills"><span class="pill">Land record</span><span class="pill">Map</span><span class="pill">Ownership</span></div></div>
  <div class="card life"><b>✈️ Immigration & abroad</b><p>Visa, immigration, consular and foreign-employment starting points.</p><div class="pills"><span class="pill">Visa</span><span class="pill">Immigration</span><span class="pill">Abroad</span></div></div>
  <div class="card life"><b>🏦 Finance & consumer</b><p>Tax, banking guidance, digital-payment safety and consumer help.</p><div class="pills"><span class="pill">Tax</span><span class="pill">Payments</span><span class="pill">Safety</span></div></div>
  <div class="card life"><b>💼 Jobs & careers</b><p>Government vacancy discovery, job preparation and training resources.</p><div class="pills"><span class="pill">Jobs</span><span class="pill">Lok Sewa</span><span class="pill">Training</span></div></div>
  <div class="card life"><b>🏥 Health</b><p>Hospital, pharmacy, blood and public-health resources in one place.</p><div class="pills"><span class="pill">Hospital</span><span class="pill">Blood</span><span class="pill">Pharmacy</span></div></div>
  <div class="card life"><b>🏛️ Local government</b><p>Province, district, municipality and ward-level information should become searchable.</p><div class="pills"><span class="pill">Province</span><span class="pill">Municipality</span><span class="pill">Ward</span></div></div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="section">
<div class="section-head"><div><h2>Personal tools</h2><p>Features that make NepalSathi useful after the first visit.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature-grid">
  <div class="card feature"><div class="feature-icon" style="background:#eaf8ef">⭐</div><h3>Saved services</h3><p>Save frequently used services and reopen them without searching again.</p><div class="actions"><button class="btn green" onclick="showSaved()">Open saved</button></div></div>
  <div class="card feature"><div class="feature-icon" style="background:#eef4ff">☑️</div><h3>Document checklists</h3><p>Tick off preparation items for each task and keep progress in your browser.</p><div class="actions"><button class="btn blue" onclick="showAnswer('passport')">Try checklist</button></div></div>
  <div class="card feature"><div class="feature-icon" style="background:#fff5e8">⏰</div><h3>Expiry reminders</h3><p>Store reminders for passport, license, documents, exams and appointments.</p><div class="actions"><button class="btn orange" onclick="focusTrack()">Add reminder</button></div></div>
  <div class="card feature"><div class="feature-icon" style="background:#f2edff">🗂️</div><h3>Application tracker</h3><p>Track your own reference number, service, submission date and status note locally.</p><div class="actions"><button class="btn purple" onclick="focusTrack()">Track application</button></div></div>
  <div class="card feature"><div class="feature-icon" style="background:#eaf8ef">🎙️</div><h3>Voice search</h3><p>Ask by voice when typing is inconvenient.</p><div class="actions"><button class="btn green" onclick="startVoiceSearch()">Try it</button></div></div>
  <div class="card feature"><div class="feature-icon" style="background:#eef4ff">🖨️</div><h3>Print / share</h3><p>Print a guide or share the current page with a family member.</p><div class="actions"><button class="btn blue" onclick="printAnswer()">Print guide</button><button class="btn gray" onclick="shareCurrent()">Share</button></div></div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="scamSection" class="section">
<div class="section-head"><div><h2>🚨 Scam & suspicious-message checker</h2><p>Paste an SMS, WhatsApp message, email or social-media message.</p></div></div>
<div class="card scam">
  <p>This quick checker looks for common red flags such as OTP requests, upfront payments, fake prizes, urgency and suspicious links. It is not proof that a message is safe.</p>
  <div class="scam-area">
    <textarea id="scamText" placeholder="Example: Congratulations! You won Rs. 50,000. Send Rs. 2,000 and your OTP now..."></textarea>
    <button class="btn" style="background:#fff;color:#344054" onclick="checkScam()">CHECK</button>
  </div>
  <div id="risk" class="risk"></div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="trackerSection" class="section">
<div class="section-head"><div><h2>🗂️ My application & document tracker</h2><p>Stored only in your browser. Don't enter passwords, OTPs or sensitive banking secrets.</p></div></div>
<div class="track-grid">
  <div class="card">
